{"id":3,"date":"2021-09-02T23:03:07","date_gmt":"2021-09-02T23:03:07","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/?page_id=3"},"modified":"2021-09-18T15:35:15","modified_gmt":"2021-09-18T13:35:15","slug":"gdpr","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/gdpr\/","title":{"rendered":"Zpracov\u00e1n\u00ed osobn\u00edch \u00fadaj\u016f a GDPR"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Na z\u00e1klad\u011b z\u00e1kona \u010d. 101\/2000 Sb. O ochran\u011b osobn\u00edch \u00fadaj\u016f a Na\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed Evropsk\u00e9ho parlamentu a Rady (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR) bychom r\u00e1di informovali sv\u00e9 klientyo rozsahu zpracov\u00e1n\u00ed jejich osobn\u00edch \u00fadaj\u016f:<\/p>\n<ol>\n<li>Abychom mohli zajistit va\u0161i \u00fa\u010dast v\u00a0kurzech zpracov\u00e1v\u00e1me va\u0161e osobn\u00ed \u00fadaje \u00a0v\u00a0n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00edm rozsahu:<strong>\u00a0jm\u00e9no, email a\u00a0telefonn\u00ed \u010d\u00edslo<\/strong>, (p\u0159\u00edpadn\u011b va\u0161e faktura\u010dn\u00ed \u00fadaje, chcete-li vystavit fakturu), a\u00a0to pouze za \u00fa\u010delem poskytov\u00e1n\u00ed slu\u017eeb dle uzav\u0159en\u00e9ho kontraktu.<\/li>\n<li>Tyto \u00fadaje jsou pro vykon\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed zmi\u0148ovan\u00fdch slu\u017eeb nutn\u00e9 \u2013 pot\u0159ebujeme klienty informovat o\u00a0p\u0159\u00edpadn\u00e9 zm\u011bn\u011b term\u00edn\u016f, zas\u00edlat jim pot\u0159ebn\u00e9 informace apod. Nejsou pou\u017e\u00edv\u00e1ny k\u00a0\u017e\u00e1dn\u00fdm marketingov\u00fdm \u00fa\u010del\u016fm.<\/li>\n<li>Tyto \u00fadaje zpracov\u00e1v\u00e1 pouze Mgr. Al\u017eb\u011bta Rychteck\u00e1.<\/li>\n<li>Na z\u00e1klad\u011b uveden\u00fdch z\u00e1kon\u016f maj\u00ed klienti pr\u00e1vo p\u0159\u00edstupu k\u00a0t\u011bmto osobn\u00edm \u00fadaj\u016fm a\u00a0na opravu t\u011bchto \u00fadaj\u016f, jako\u017e i\u00a0dal\u0161\u00ed pr\u00e1va, stanoven\u00e1 v\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.zakonyprolidi.cz\/cs\/2000-101\">\u00a721\u00a0z\u00e1kona \u010d.101\/2000\u00a0Sb<\/a>.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n<p>V p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b jak\u00fdchkoli dotaz\u016f \u010di\u00a0p\u0159\u00e1n\u00ed vy\u0159azen\u00ed z\u00a0evidence \u00fadaj\u016f se na m\u011b pros\u00edm obra\u0165te.<\/p>\n<p>Mgr. Al\u017eb\u011bta Rychteck\u00e1<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Na z\u00e1klad\u011b z\u00e1kona \u010d. 101\/2000 Sb. O ochran\u011b osobn\u00edch \u00fadaj\u016f a Na\u0159\u00edzen\u00ed Evropsk\u00e9ho parlamentu a Rady (EU) 2016\/679 (GDPR) bychom r\u00e1di informovali sv\u00e9 klientyo rozsahu zpracov\u00e1n\u00ed jejich osobn\u00edch \u00fadaj\u016f: Abychom mohli zajistit va\u0161i \u00fa\u010dast v\u00a0kurzech zpracov\u00e1v\u00e1me va\u0161e osobn\u00ed \u00fadaje \u00a0v\u00a0n\u00e1sleduj\u00edc\u00edm rozsahu:\u00a0jm\u00e9no, email a\u00a0telefonn\u00ed \u010d\u00edslo, (p\u0159\u00edpadn\u011b va\u0161e faktura\u010dn\u00ed \u00fadaje, chcete-li vystavit fakturu), a\u00a0to pouze za \u00fa\u010delem [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","template":"","meta":{"inline_featured_image":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3"}],"version-history":[{"count":2,"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":244,"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3\/revisions\/244"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=3"}],"curies":[{"name":